 "about": "Simulation only. Water age of the operator's nominal model and of 9 demand x roughness variants of it (EPANET AGE), scored against the hidden truth's own water age; chlorine error by nominal-age group for SimGP24 at 8 random daytime samples; the chlorine loss split between the water and the pipe walls for the calibrated member and for the truth. Top-level numbers are for the first truth listed, pooled over seeds; by_truth has both.",
