  "band_coverage": "share of junctions whose true daily-mean age lies within [min, max] of the 9 members' daily-mean ages",
  "band_coverage_daily_max": "the same for the daily-maximum age (what the app's map shows)",
  "posterior": "ages weighted by the SimGP24 posterior over the 9 hydraulic members after 8 samples; band = its central 90%",
  "n_excluded": "junction-seeds whose TRUE daily-max age exceeds 160 h (the plan's rule; it misses most junctions whose age is a lower bound, see lower_bounds)",
  "lower bound": "every age is a 7-day-run age; where more than 0.05 of a junction's water is still the run's starting water (simulate.initial_water_share: daily mean, or any hour for the daily max) the age is a lower bound. lower_bounds counts them in the operator's model and the truth; converged_only repeats the age metrics on the junctions where neither is one",
