  "wall_share": "1 - L_bulk / L_tot per junction (mean over hours of ln C_ref / C); undefined below a loss of 0.02",
  "nonadditivity": "(L_bulk + L_wall) / L_tot; 1 on a single plug-flow path",
  "start_up_transient": "share of a junction's water on the scored day that is still the file's initial contents (1 - no-decay chlorine / dose) for the calibrated member: median over junctions averaged over seeds, and the largest; n_unflushed_truth counts truth junctions whose no-decay chlorine is under 95% of the lowest possible source dose"
